rooms_desc ({"As you enter this Castle you notice that a extraordianary person lives here.You notice many trophies hanging in the cases on either side of the vestibule.By looking at the Trophies you say to yourself \"I'm outa here!\", but you are draw mysterious closer to the inner door.As you reach the door you realize the only esacape from this place is to beg the owner for safe passage.All the while you pray that you not asked to join the others in the Hanging Garden.","You notice as you enter the hall that your feeling of fear and horror have    subsided. The Hall is two rooms long and connects the vistors to the main rooms of the Castle. In particular you see on the east side of the house is the study, and on the west is the Armory.To the north are two more passage ways leading to some more rooms. Remeber    in this Castle many travelers have come before you, and some have becomt residence.As you look on either wall you see pictures and many e the rest of this large Castle.There are some house rules though so please check with the owner or enter the study for more details","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
